    "abstract": "<jats:p>In this work, we present the discovery and cataloguing of a new variable star in Perseus. After its photometric study, it was concluded that we were facing a new \uf064 Scuti type variable star which, although it was included in the ZTF catalogue of periodic variables as suspected, was not adequately characterised. For our study, we used data from other sources, such as the aforementioned ZTF or ASAS-SN, and our own data. Finally, it was included in the AAVSO\u2019s The International Variable Star Index with the name GSC 03319-01926.</jats:p>",
